---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Animus Project.">
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none font-sans">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Radical Anonymity by Design</h2>
        <p>Animus is founded on respect for human expression and total anonymity. We do <strong>not</strong> want your personal identity, real name, email address, or contact list.</p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>To generate meaningful sociological consensus without compromising individual privacy, we collect only high-level, non-identifiable demographic markers:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Age Bracket:</strong> e.g., 25–34, 35–44, etc.</li>
          <li><strong>Gender:</strong> for aggregate demographic distribution.</li>
          <li><strong>General Location:</strong> broad region or country level to observe geographic perspective trends.</li>
          <li><strong>Anonymous Responses & Credits:</strong> your answers to questions and earned participation credits.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> track your real identity, sell data to third-party ad networks, or build individual behavioral profiles.</p>

        <h2>3. How We Use Aggregate Data</h2>
        <p>Data collected in Animus is organized into graph relationships (Neo4j) to compute collective consensus, reveal authentic societal concerns, and power cross-sectional research.</p>

        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>All network communication is strictly encrypted in transit using standard TLS protocols.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions regarding this privacy policy, connect with the project on X at <a href="https://x.com/animusproject" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@animusproject</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
